The '''Morlani system''',<ref name="Andor1" /> also known as the '''Morlana system''',<ref name="Aldhani" /> was a [[star system]] located in the [[Free Trade sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]] that contained the [[planet]]s [[Ferrix]] and [[Morlana One]].<ref name="Andor1" />

During the [[Imperial Era]] the [[Consolidated Holdings of Preox-Morlana Corporation|Preox-Morlana]] corporation admistered the planet [[Morlana One]] and had loose control over [[Ferrix]].<ref name="Andor1" /> After the [[Ambush on Ferrix|Ferrix incident]] the system was taken over by the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Aldhani" />

